  "Description": {
    "Cost": 4735940,
    "UIName": "Erebus",
    "Id": "chassisdef_erebus_ERE-P1",
    "Name": "Erebus",
    "Details": "The P1 variant of the Erebus mounts a Large Improved Heavy Laser and an ER Large Laser in each arm besides the Downsized Mass Driver. Being the first prototype in the line of the chassis, it still is considered one of the better. The main weakness, like all the other models, is the low weapons count.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.4</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_erebus"
  },
