  "StockRole": "Experimental Weapons Platform",
  "YangsThoughts": "A co-operation between Clan Sea Fox and Clan Nova Cat - mainly with resources from the latter, the Erebus is a specially designed chassis to mount the downsized Mass Driver - a giant ballistic weapon making autocannons look like pea shooters. The 'Mech has special stabilizing equipment and advanced targeting fire control systems, to attempt improving the Mass Driver performance. The 'Mech and its weapon is mostly seen as a waste of time by other Clans, as it is far too heavy and hot to be useful.",
